/* The complementary R2-type statement pinning the boundary: a synchronized angle
 * equilibrium (theta' = 0, i.e. M = Vg*sin(theta), encoded M = Vg*s with s^2<=1) exists iff
 * the forcing is within the restoring envelope, M^2 <= Vg^2.  Past it (M^2>Vg^2) F3a gives
 * unbounded drift.  This is the equilibrium-level fold Sigma_fold|_{angle}; the genuine
 * limit-cycle fold sits past Sigma_H and is the validated-numerics part. */
Problem
  \forall M \forall Vg
  ( Vg > 0 ->
    ( ( \exists s ( s^2 <= 1 & M = Vg*s ) ) <-> M^2 <= Vg^2 ) )
End.
